    "title": "A better order of steps",
    "body": "Reorder the saga: save the order, **reserve stock first**, then charge the card, then confirm. Now a stock failure needs only one compensation, cancelling the order, and the customer is never charged. Put steps that are likely to fail or cheap to undo early. And send the confirmation email **last**: it cannot be taken back, so it waits until every risky step has succeeded.",
